          </property>
         </widget>
        </item>
        <item>
         <widget class="QTextEdit" name="txtReglas">
          <property name="styleSheet">
           <string>background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 230); border-radius: 10px; padding: 15px; font-size: 14px;</string>
          </property>
          <property name="readOnly">
           <bool>true</bool>
          </property>
          <property name="html">
           <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;meta charset=&quot;utf-8&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
hr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }
li.unchecked::marker { content: &quot;\2610&quot;; }
li.checked::marker { content: &quot;\2612&quot;; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:x-large; font-weight:700; color:#2c3e50;&quot;&gt;Dinámica Básica&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;El juego es un combate estratégico de cartas elementales. Cada jugador elige una carta viva para atacar, y el daño dependerá de las debilidades y fortalezas de cada elemento.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot; margin-top:14px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:large; font-weight:700; color:#2980b9;&quot;&gt;Elementos Comunes (Triángulo de poder)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700; color:#c0392b;&quot;&gt;Fuego&lt;/span&gt; quema a la &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700; color:#27ae60;&quot;&gt;Tierra&lt;/span&gt; (Daño x2)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700; color:#27ae60;&quot;&gt;Tierra&lt;/span&gt; absorbe al &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700; color:#2980b9;&quot;&gt;Agua&lt;/span&gt; (Daño x2)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700; color:#2980b9;&quot;&gt;Agua&lt;/span&gt; apaga al &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700; color:#c0392b;&quot;&gt;Fuego&lt;/span&gt; (Daño x2)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot; margin-top:14px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:large; font-weight:700; color:#8e44ad;&quot;&gt;Elementos Mixtos&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Los elementos mixtos combinan ataques y defensas de dos elementos comunes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Lava&lt;/span&gt;: Ataca como Fuego, defiende como Tierra.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Barro&lt;/span&gt;: Ataca como Tierra, defiende como Agua.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Vapor&lt;/span&gt;: Ataca como Agua, defiende como Fuego.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;¡Planea tus movimientos y usa la &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Pista de IA&lt;/span&gt; sabiamente para anticiparte a los ataques de tu enemigo!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
          </property>
         </widget>
